{"text":"kuruntokai","n":146,"lines":["அம்ம வாழி தோழி நம்மூர்ப்","பிரிந்தோர்ப் புணர்ப்போர் இருந்தனர் கொல்லோ","தண்டுடைக் கையர் வெண்டலைச் சிதவலர்","நன்றுநன் றென்னு மாக்களோ","டின்றுபெரி தென்னும் ஆங்கண தவையே"],"tr":["amma vāḻi tōḻi nammūrp","pirintōrp puṇarppōr iruntaṉar kollō","taṇṭuṭaik kaiyar veṇṭalaic citavalar","naṉṟunaṉ ṟeṉṉu mākkaḷō","ṭiṉṟuperi teṉṉum āṅkaṇa tavaiyē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"வெள்ளி வீதியார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Veḷḷi Vītiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 9"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அம்ம","tr":"amma","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அம்","tr":"am"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ம","tr":"ma"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"நம்மூர்ப்","tr":"nammūrp","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நம்","tr":"nam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மூர்ப்","tr":"mūrp"}]}],[{"text":"பிரிந்தோர்ப்","tr":"pirintōrp","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிரிந்","tr":"pirin"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோர்ப்","tr":"tōrp"}]},{"text":"புணர்ப்போர்","tr":"puṇarppōr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புணர்ப்","tr":"puṇarp"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"போர்","tr":"pōr"}]},{"text":"இருந்தனர்","tr":"iruntaṉar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இருந்","tr":"irun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தனர்","tr":"taṉar"}]},{"text":"கொல்லோ","tr":"kollō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோ","tr":"lō"}]}],[{"text":"தண்டுடைக்","tr":"taṇṭuṭaik","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுடைக்","tr":"ṭuṭaik"}]},{"text":"கையர்","tr":"kaiyar","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"வெண்டலைச்","tr":"veṇṭalaic","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டலைச்","tr":"ṭalaic"}]},{"text":"சிதவலர்","tr":"citavalar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சித","tr":"cita"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வலர்","tr":"valar"}]}],[{"text":"நன்றுநன்","tr":"naṉṟunaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுநன்","tr":"ṟunaṉ"}]},{"text":"றென்னு","tr":"ṟeṉṉu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றென்","tr":"ṟeṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னு","tr":"ṉu"}]},{"text":"மாக்களோ","tr":"mākkaḷō","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாக்","tr":"māk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"களோ","tr":"kaḷō"}]}],[{"text":"டின்றுபெரி","tr":"ṭiṉṟuperi","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"டின்","tr":"ṭiṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுபெ","tr":"ṟupe"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரி","tr":"ri"}]},{"text":"தென்னும்","tr":"teṉṉum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தென்","tr":"teṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னும்","tr":"ṉum"}]},{"text":"ஆங்கண","tr":"āṅkaṇa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆங்","tr":"āṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கண","tr":"kaṇa"}]},{"text":"தவையே","tr":"tavaiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தவை","tr":"tavai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"அம்ம","gloss":"expletive/listen"}],"gloss":"listen"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழ்","gloss":"may you live"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"oh friend"},{"surface":"நம்மூர்ப்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"நம்","gloss":"our"},{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"ப்","gloss":"sandhi consonant"}],"gloss":"in our town"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிரிந்தோர்ப்","parts":[{"text":"பிரிந்தோர்","lemma":"பிரிந்தோர்","gloss":"those who separated"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"ப்","gloss":"sandhi consonant"}],"gloss":"those who separated"},{"surface":"புணர்ப்போர்","parts":[{"text":"புணர்ப்போர்","lemma":"புணர்ப்போர்","gloss":"those who unite"}],"gloss":"those who unite"},{"surface":"இருந்தனர்","parts":[{"text":"இருந்தனர்","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"they existed"}],"gloss":"did they exist"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"indeed (expressing wonder/doubt)"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தண்டுடைக்","parts":[{"text":"தண்டு","lemma":"தண்டு","gloss":"staff"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"possessing"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"sandhi consonant"}],"gloss":"having staves"},{"surface":"கையர்","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"they (honorific/plural)"}],"gloss":"those with in hand"},{"surface":"வெண்டலைச்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்டலைச்","lemma":"வெண்டலைச்","gloss":"white-haired heads"}],"gloss":"white-haired heads","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிதவலர்","parts":[{"text":"சிதவல்","lemma":"சிதவல்","gloss":"rag/head-cloth"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"they (honorific/plural)"}],"gloss":"those with head-cloths"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்று","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"நன்று","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"நன்று","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"நன்று","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"என்னும்","parts":[{"text":"என்னும்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"மாக்களோ","parts":[{"text":"மாக்கள்","lemma":"மாக்கள்","gloss":"people"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓடு","gloss":"with (truncated)"}],"gloss":"with those people"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"டின்று","parts":[{"text":"டின்று","lemma":"டின்று","gloss":"today"}],"gloss":"today","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெரிது","parts":[{"text":"பெரிது","lemma":"பெரிது","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"it is very great"},{"surface":"என்னும்","parts":[{"text":"என்னும்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"ஆங்கணது","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"there"},{"text":"அண்","lemma":"அண்","gloss":"place"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of that place"},{"surface":"அவையே","parts":[{"text":"அவை","lemma":"அவை","gloss":"assembly"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed in the assembly"}]}],"literal":"Oh friend, may you live! In our town / those who unite the separated, did they exist? / Those with staves in hand, with white-haired heads covered in rags, / with those people who say 'Good, good!' / today saying 'It is very great!' in the assembly of that place.","translation":"Live long, my friend! Did there ever exist in our town those who could reunite separated lovers? In the assembly of that place, the elders—holding staves in their hands, their white-haired heads wrapped in rags—who usually say, 'Good, good!' are today saying, 'This is a very great thing!'","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! நம் ஊரில் பிரிந்தவர்களைச் சேர்த்து வைப்பவர்கள் இருந்தார்களா? கையில் தடியை ஏந்தி, நரைத்த தலையில் தலைப்பாகை அணிந்த பெரியவர்கள், எப்போதும் 'நல்லது, நல்லது' என்று சொல்பவர்கள், இன்று அந்த ஊர் அவையிலே 'இது மிகவும் பெரிய காரியம்' என்று கூறுகிறார்களே!","explanation":"The confidante is speaking to the heroine after the hero's arrival or the formal proposal of marriage. She wonders aloud if there were ever people in their town capable of bringing separated lovers back together. She points to the assembly of wise elders, who hold walking sticks and wear white head-cloths over their grey hair. These elders, who normally nod in approval saying \"Good, good,\" are today astonished and declaring this union to be \"a very great thing!\" This public validation by the town's assembly brings immense relief and joy, transitioning their secret love into a socially accepted marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.36],[0.36,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.69],[1.69,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.5,3.78],[3.78,4.25],[4.25,4.54],[4.54,5.01],[5.01,5.48],[5.48,5.95],[5.95,6.3],[6.3,7.41],[7.41,8.79],[8.79,9.9],[9.9,10.05],[10.2,10.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.7],[1.7,2.94],[2.94,3.26],[3.3,4.1],[4.1,4.63],[4.63,5.24],[5.24,5.6],[5.6,6.05],[6.05,6.49],[6.49,6.94],[6.94,7.2],[7.2,7.56],[7.56,7.7],[7.7,8.21],[8.21,9.98],[9.98,11.3]]},"sync":[[["அம்ம","listen"]],[["வாழி","may you live long"]],[["தோழி","oh friend"]],[["நம்மூர்ப்","in our town"]],[["பிரிந்தோர்ப்","those who separated"]],[["புணர்ப்போர்","those who unite"]],[["இருந்தனர்","did they exist"]],[["கொல்லோ","indeed (expressing wonder/doubt)"]],[["தண்டுடைக்","having staves"]],[["கையர்","those with in hand"]],[["வெண்டலைச்","white-haired heads"]],[["சிதவலர்","those with head-cloths"]],[["நன்று","good"],["நன்று","good"]],[["நன்று","good"],["என்னும்","saying"]],[["மாக்களோ","with those people"]],[["டின்று","today"],["பெரிது","it is very great"]],[["பெரிது","it is very great"],["என்னும்","saying"]],[["ஆங்கணது","of that place"]],[["ஆங்கணது","of that place"],["அவையே","indeed in the assembly"]]]}